@startuml
title Snapshot Engine — Recorded Before Each Transfer
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

actor Caller
participant "CMTAT" as T
participant "SnapshotEngine\n(optional, external)" as S

Caller -> T : transfer / mint / burn
T -> T : _update(from, to, value)
hnote right of T : before balances change
T -> S : operateOnTransfer(from, to,\n  balanceFrom, balanceTo, totalSupply)
S -> S : record balances & total supply\nat the current block
S --> T : return
T -> T : apply balance changes (super._update)
@enduml
